<p class=GENELKURUL style='line-height:normal'><span style='font-size:9.0pt;
mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt'>Ayn&#305; mahiyetteki 2’nci önergenin imza
sahipleri:<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=3LMZA style='line-height:normal'><span style='font-size:9.0pt;
mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt'><span style='mso-tab-count:1'>                </span>Alpay
Antmen<span style='mso-tab-count:1'>                             </span>Engin
Özkoç<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=3LMZA style='line-height:normal'><span style='font-size:9.0pt;
mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt'><span style='mso-tab-count:1'>                     </span>Mersin<span
