(A&#287;r&#305;) – Sistem mi b&#305;rakt&#305;n&#305;z?<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=GENELKURUL style='line-height:normal'><span style='font-size:9.0pt;
mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt'>MAH&#304;R ÜNAL (Devamla) – Yasa
